# Generated Code — Do Not Edit

Files under `gen/` are automatically generated by the Goa framework. **Never edit them directly.**

Any change made here will be overwritten the next time someone runs:

```bash
make generate
```

## If you need to change the API shape

Edit the DSL source files instead:

- `api/voting/v1/design/voting.go` — endpoint definitions
- `api/voting/v1/design/types.go` — request/response types

Then run `make generate` and commit both the design changes and the updated `gen/` together.

## If you need to change generated behavior

Goa-generated server code lives in `gen/http/`. Application-level behavior belongs in `cmd/voting-api/api.go` (handler implementation) — not in the generated transport layer.
